    "text": "I make my mom work so hard to find pictures of me for Tongue Out Tuesday. 👅 It just isn’t where my strengths lie. What can I say? We all have areas where we shine, and you know where mine is. #dogs #dogsofbluesky #TOT #goldendoodle￼￼",
