    "at": "2026-11-06T13:57:07.834Z",
    "author": "robreed.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:rf3v53nmti47pq6eqol742mz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mznikwj6722q",
    "text": "Ohhh that looks so relaxing… what is so needed after this week!\nEnjoy! Enjoy! Enjoy!\nI’m off for my morning dog walk! Breathe in some of this cool morning air!\nThank you!\nHave an amazing Friday and an awesome weekend!💙🤗",
    "likes": 1,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-06T13:31:39.044Z",
    "author": "jstmeinmo.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:qnjjpnojtiwrfvwaggfjjih2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mznghs6bsk25",
    "text": "Good morning!\n\nYesterday, I played a bunch of Loftia and getting my frames lost in the Overgrowth. I completed all the research stations and made a decent chunk of story progress.\n\nToday, I need to work on my project that I want to have done by my birthday next week 😤\n\nHave a wonderful Friday!",
    "likes": 5,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 2,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-06T12:54:06.336Z",
    "author": "shadowkarak.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:dhukedhe3h4ot3yrfzlhomcs/app.bsky.feed.post/3mznfq5xv6c23",
    "text": "Guten Morgen euch allen.\nYour Friday pizza awaits you, my wonderful friends! 🌞😀😊🤗\n\n@kaceykells.bsky.social \n@myviewsmary.bsky.social \n@midnightblue34.bsky.social \n@zee207702.bsky.social",
    "likes": 3,
    "reposts": 2,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-06T12:40:53.413Z",
    "author": "gaspatient.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:ixvt6bzdkvrhknp7rlcftzov/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzncxy56lc2p",
    "text": "Morning my sweety. Wishing you a fab Friday and an amazing weekend. 💃🎶💋🍁🥰 Hope you’re able to relax a bit.",
    "likes": 1,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-06T11:51:34.506Z",
    "author": "daniellemndem.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:fob7l2gylm5eilgq36madpoz/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlujnbngs27",
    "text": "Sometimes, like the dogs last Friday and the week before, I know when I can let Newt off leash to play with them.\nAs much as I love golden retrievers (I had one), I would not have trusted my dog with this one at all. If you want a dog, learn their body language first please…",
    "likes": 5,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-05T22:00:21.231Z",
    "author": "bl3iz-du.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:zpysgqo4l7toy4jszvprupeu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlqo2wmg22o",
    "text": "This week's Five for Friday\n\nFat Dog - The Devil\nFontaines DC - Tongue\nThe Tubs - Stoop To Me\nBilly Hawks - (Oh Baby) I Believe I’m Losing You\nFour Below Zero - My Baby's Got ESP (12\" Version)\n\nHave a great weekend",
    "likes": 0,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-05T20:51:14.801Z",
    "author": "lordyemsworth.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:nlkfffedzu5yzoen66ao7zr7/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlnn6j6dkj4",
    "text": "My weekend #Twitch schedule! I'm starting as a noodle bar owner in a cyberpunk city made of voxels. Then more hairy dogs.\n\n🍜 Friday - Nivalis Nights\n🐶 Sunday - Heir Of The Dog\n\nAn 8pm UK time start on both days, but the real sexy people get there a little early 😉\n\nwww.twitch.tv/mrtomftw",
    "likes": 2,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-05T19:57:03.774Z",
    "author": "mrtom.uk"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:nbjpya2sjhe7mrzztokwdva5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzlai4i2a22x",
    "text": "This is long overdue. The Netherlands has managed to do it. Think of the animals, both domestic & wild, not to mention the tens of thousands (If not more) of humans who will suffer terribly tonight, and Friday/Saturday and then again at New Years. I already dread hearing my neighbour's dog crying.",
    "likes": 0,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-05T16:01:35.224Z",
    "author": "blooms-ghost.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:e63himx7bxogakuhbkacbjcv/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzjktwethk2i",
    "text": "I have to go back to cov on friday because my dog is dying. When Polo died I was on holiday and couldn't get back in time and I still feel so guilty about it so I'm glad I get to be there for Harvey, but I wish I hadn't moved away and got to spend more time with him",
    "likes": 0,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-05T00:01:49.420Z",
    "author": "chekhovsbum.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:wifmomicr72ityuthsmdwbih/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzip2ocb3s2d",
    "text": "Median is fine.\n\nBut great is optimal.  You have to work on that.  Lol\n\nI did. Thank you.  I hope you did as well.\n\nI spent time from Friday to Saturday with one of my relatives.  She had a sleepover with me, visited her dog Im caring for, enjoyed a couple kinds of popcorn, and took in a few...",
    "likes": 1,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-04T15:44:31.057Z",
    "author": "gigiangel.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:rdmi5wi2777fwa46t2kgtfwt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzi6mrn3c22b",
    "text": "🐶 GOT THAT DOG IN ME 🐶\n\nVery excited to reveal the exclusive print I have made for @hellododo.bsky.social 's Oh My Dog exhibition launching this Friday!! 🐕🦮🐩🐕‍🦺🐕‍🦺🦴\n\n#dogillustration #dogartwork #risograph #risography #risoprint",
    "likes": 0,
