    "text": "Good, good morning 🌞☀️😃 from Darwin , everyone’s favorite heathen Havanese.\nHe refuses to jump out of my bed until he hears his bowl hit the floor. He no dummy 😉\nPiss\nOn\nEverything\nTomorrow’s \nSaturday 🥸",
