  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:lmd65khvj7lcximdzz3fju3j/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzb2d6y5ik23",
    "text": "Oh boy. I have a virus type thingie. Achey and threw up this morning.  Super weak.\n\nI'm sure I got it from Elle. She was sick on Friday into Saturday but really wanted MawMaw.\n\nI made her a bed on a dog cot on the floor beside my bed. She loved it. \n\nShe felt better on Saturday . Heres to hoping 🤞",
    "likes": 7,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 3,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-01T14:44:50.242Z",
    "author": "rcmhere.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:6rm4gb75sq4fslujagfefh4e/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzaryduui227",
    "text": "I wish the rapture would happen, already. I'm tired of these aholes knocking on my door, \"spreading the gospel\" or whatever they call it. It's seven in the morning on a Saturday, nut bags. Next time I let the dog answer.🙄",
    "likes": 0,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-01T12:15:36.342Z",
    "author": "genxtoo.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:tihrzliudq7uovu44xe2lej3/app.bsky.feed.post/3mz6dhlrru227",
    "text": "Good Saturday morning and happy Halloween, friends! 🎃 Diesel insisted I get out of bed so he could show me that Angus knocked a plant onto the floor. My pets are toddlers. C's got the W, B's play tonight. Today is Samhain, Doorbell Day, and Caramel Apple Day. HAGD! ☕️🍩",
    "likes": 2,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 1,
    "at": "2026-10-31T12:50:22.345Z",
    "author": "debimc.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:ulyhmxf4xdowaj7waeyee3dk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mz5xq2nkv22o",
    "text": "@stacy17.bsky.social \n\nGood morning Cassandra \n  Enjoy the weekend my friend 🎃\n   Happy Saturday ☕🍁🍂👋",
    "likes": 1,
    "reposts": 1,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-10-31T09:20:21.466Z",
    "author": "eileena.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:fjjkvegpr4pzvmwpd4uw6njr/app.bsky.feed.post/3myqjyb5jf322",
    "text": "Dogpark\n\nSaturday morning. 8:00 AM. Forty fucking degrees. My wife woke me up to help with the Belmont County Dogpark Dog Festival. Because apparently, sleeping in on a Saturday is an unreasonable expectation when there are tents to set up and shit to haul around. We helped get the festival ready,…",
