    "text": "there's a metric shit ton of great sports on today. and my wife is giving me side-eye for wanting to sit on the couch and enjoy the action because it's \"nice out\" and the dog \"would love a walk\" and \"don't you want to get some exercise and fresh air\". whatever, man.",
