    "text": "I’ve been derelict in my golden retriever spotting duties! This week’s Park Walk totals:\n\nTuesday: 6!\nWednesday: 4\nThursday: 6 again!\nFriday: only 1 but it was raining \nToday: 4, including a puppy!!! \n\n#goldenretriever #goldenretrievers #goldens #livingmylifelikeitagolden #nyc #nyclife #centralpark",
