    "text": "Today I had a little surgery for what the Dr thought was cyst under my baby toe but may have been an irritated and swollen nerve. I can’t walk the pups for a bit but I’ve enlisted help from family, friends, and Jog My Dog (dog walkers) so they will be well exercised",
