    "text": "today is my last day of brain radiation treatment. #30. it's been a long slog. but i get to ring the bell!! \n\none more dog to walk and a little quick nap before going down there later. can't wait. \n\ni feel pretty awful today but am buoyed knowing it's my last day. i sure hope this has been worth it.",
