    "text": "Noticed today, 48hrs after the \"short flat\" walk with my friend, my legs are still v achy with painful spots in my calves to the point where I'm hobbling a bit. \nIt's now 12 days since the dog went & about 15 days since our last real short walk. Could it be deconditioning after all?",
