    "text": "I leave the TV on for my dog when I’m at work and I came home tonight and the Barbie movie was on. I watched to the end. It’s my third time. God damn, I love this movie so much. Ordinarily, I’m all about you do you and taste is subjective. But if you don’t love the shit out of this film, WTF?",
