    "text": "Sorry to hear things are below par in the NF household, hope it all improves.\nI'm struggling with a carol rewrite, too many chord options.\nOn my own today so doing all the dog walking, fortunately it's dry and sunny.\nTheatre trip to see a musical version of Made in Dagenham tonight, should be fun.",
