    "text": "So I got an hour or so of sleep tonight. I woke up drenched in sweat from an awful nightmare but I don’t remember it which isn’t normal for me, I usually remember my dreams especially nightmares.\n\nAfter scrolling on my phone in bed I relocated to the living room where my dog proceeded to get sick. 🥲",
