    "text": "Goodnight to all you wonderful people in my phone! What a week, but what a relaxing evening I had. Constant husky cuddles ALL evening! Sometimes surrounded by all 3 at once.\n\nI’m a very happy dog mom tonight 🥰\n\nNothing purer than a pup’s love and empathy.\n\nBe good to yourselves, and each other!\n✨💖✨",
