    "text": "tonight in my dragon game: you all meet at your friends' parents' house, these losers can't afford to hire a guide, a mysterious dog in the snow (probably fine), agreed to help a bounty hunter retire, harangued a drunk, bribed a tavernkeeper, tracked a serial killer, and asked him out",
