    "text": "Wow he's a real beauty 😍 Noise phobias are really common in dogs. I've written 2 articles that may help you help him:\nIs Your Dog Scared of Thunder? 8 Tips You Need to Know!: catanddoghouse.com/dogs-scared-...\nFireworks Freaking Out Your Dog? Here's What to Do: catanddoghouse.com/dog-fear-of-...",
