    "text": "💥 Bonfire Night can be terrifying for dogs. Loud bangs and flashes can make even calm pets panic and run. Keep them indoors, stay calm and secure your home. 🏠🐾\nFind out why scared dogs don’t always come back 👉 http://bit.ly/43vP7wl\n#BonfireNight #DogSafety #FireworksAndDogs #CannyCompany",
