    "text": "Ugh. Apparently, someone set the neighbor-dog alarm to 5:30AM this morning. It has been barking non-stop for the past 15+ minutes. I can think of one medication to treat dog-induced insomnia, but I am not that cruel. Guess I’ll start my Sunday. Where’s my coffee?",
