    "text": "Had a gully washer of a storm in the wee hours of the morning. Lots of ⚡️ and Sóla heard/barked at each loud crack and boom. Plan to paint on glass today so it can be fired before Sunday. If I’m not creating art with my hands w/music, the walls close in. Lampwork class tomorrow will be so much fun.",
