    "text": "An oak drops ten thousand acorns. On a walk, I stopped over one that landed where it can’t grow and thought: what a waste. The oak has no favorite. Why do I?\n\nA Sunday walk, a forest floor full of acorns, and the very human need to make one life matter.\n\nwww.matthewkerns.com/blog/the-one...",
