    "text": "How I Learned to Love My Dog By Observing His Behavior: It was Sunday, a week since Freddie had arrived. He and I had just gone for a walk in the park near my apartment, our second of the day. In the park, old people sat around tables playing mahjong, and #Features #Memoir",
