    "text": "This is my dog Gaston. He passed away on Sunday but he was the best dog in the world. He showed me he loved me even when he couldn’t walk, by shuffling his front feet around to make room for me to sit with him while he meeped every morning. \n\nHe would jump into any body of water that I was in, too.",
