  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:te4kfxtu2fmlhcjku5cox73c/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxmmbseola2g",
    "text": "A big THANK YOU to everyone who attended our Walk To Cure Parkinson’s event today in Battersea! 🧡💙\n\nWe’re incredibly excited to announce that you can now save the date for 2027’s #WalkToCure event - taking place on World Parkinson’s Day on Sunday 11 April! More details to be announced soon🚶‍➡️",
