    "text": "Tomorrow at 10 AM I am unfortunately going to be putting our family dog down. It's the humane thing to do for her. She's old, she's lived a life with love and care from Me and my folks...\n\nMy heart is aching and me and my folks had a good cry together with her today after I voted.",
    "likes": 36,
    "reposts": 1,
    "replies": 8,
    "quotes": 1,
    "at": "2026-11-04T01:40:57.806Z",
    "author": "erospertempus.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:gzfxwkyow25wgdytcfkunpix/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzgqqtx7js2m",
    "text": "So today Mom comes at me with the whole \"Oh we can't go out tomorrow, it's going to rain\"......just, seriously?\n\nI almost got ATTACKED by a damn dog on her birthday, not her fault obviously, but my point is I made the effort when the day was less than ideal. \n\nShe wanted to put the my birthday off--",
    "likes": 0,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-03T21:09:29.451Z",
    "author": "littleblueorca.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:nlvpb3aiu2rhyidy6e5o7svt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzf6enmohk2z",
    "text": "Bonjour! Ah, but might you get to skive off early?\nI can hear violent rain out there! Jolly brr too.\nCleaning fairy comes today!\nI'll be ironing & getting room ready for dog/house sitter at the weekend. I'll get to see my 3 nieces yeay!!! It will be a welcome break & some UK retail therapy!",
    "likes": 4,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 2,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-03T06:07:53.068Z",
    "author": "clucksky.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:ut67tdxisulkzco74cpxuisv/app.bsky.feed.post/3mz7jrpitrs2l",
    "text": "Here are my boys after taking a quick walk around the neighborhood between rain events. Their first in 2 weeks!  I'm grateful for this beautiful Autumn weather for many reasons but today it was nice 'cause Nat's rain coat protects his recent injury. 🧡🐾👟",
    "likes": 9,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-11-01T00:16:03.978Z",
    "author": "lmc55g95.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:wa4rryxczavge3knhgdi2rnr/app.bsky.feed.post/3mz3t64yrwc2u",
    "text": "five years ago today, I hiked the \"Devil In A Day\" in pretty gnarly weather conditions. what an experience 😅\n\nkinda wanna do it again",
    "likes": 22,
    "reposts": 2,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-10-30T12:53:25.502Z",
    "author": "katbridges.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:vjep5jjzxmxqjgupyghla2wm/app.bsky.feed.post/3myqf5pajms22",
    "text": "I fear this is perhaps TOO mean, but I had a HUGE pumpkin spice latte today, so now I'm even WILDER of a devil-may-care than Sam after a particularly concentrated Ribena and TWO packs of Salt n'vinegar??",
    "likes": 2,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-10-25T23:43:21.575Z",
    "author": "squery.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:rm64cnqyiijn3sqsqcgvhebd/app.bsky.feed.post/3myi4gscdxs2v",
    "text": "with that said, i'm back on the street today because rain over and short stays are more expensive than long ones per day.\n\ni'm waiting on a new dog rescue, and need to keep keiko's (my dog's) wound clean so if we could swing a solid week stay, it would probably save an infection. check out in 1 hour",
    "likes": 5,
    "reposts": 8,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 3,
    "at": "2026-10-22T16:46:05.187Z",
    "author": "shrimpsdude.com"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:3hlyianphcex2afqutbwnhf2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxytbas4dc2i",
    "text": "We’ve had tons of rain- but today will be sunny.\nMy little dog will get to romp in the park.\nHope you have a fabulous Friday🤗",
    "likes": 1,
    "reposts": 0,
    "replies": 1,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-10-16T14:51:59.306Z",
    "author": "pantrywoman.bsky.social"
  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:rm64cnqyiijn3sqsqcgvhebd/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtygeyfqs2g",
    "text": "today is officially 2 months on the street and something in me broke last night.\n\ntrying to scrape together $700/week for a shitty motel seems impossible, and so does ever getting my dog rehomed humanely.\n\nfeel free to spare what you can (more rain near) but i'm taking a hiatus for now. i'm tired.",
    "likes": 4,
    "reposts": 4,
    "replies": 0,
    "quotes": 0,
    "at": "2026-10-14T16:41:01.493Z",
