  },
  {
    "uri": "at://did:plc:hrnfdsucpidp4du7gs4ezqlh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxqewnun522f",
    "text": "She did it was so grey and miserable yesterday wasn’t it a perfect day for a bit of telly watching. I got sucked in my first walk but we avoided the rain in the afternoon. Off to dog walking group this morning 👍. Have a fab day today Adrian and I’ll report back later 🐶🐾😘",
    "likes": 2,
    "reposts": 0,
